+ * @BCM2712_SB_HVS: Hardware Video Scaler (HVS) display composition engine bus
+ * @BCM2712_SB_V3D7: VideoCore VII 3D graphics hardware pipeline bus
+ * @BCM2712_SB_ISP: Image Sensor Processor (ISP) camera pipeline bus
